contentText:
Rosalía has reacted to the multiple nominations she received at the 2027 Grammy Awards. She’s the second-most nominated with nine, following Raye, who leads this year’s list with 11.&nbsp;

After the nominations were announced on Monday (Nov. 16), the Spanish artist celebrated with her more than 27 million followers on Instagram, sharing a short clip where she’s seen popping a bottle of champagne in a backyard and jumping around with joy.&nbsp;

